Id: root003w
Severity: WARN
Category: accounts
Check: check_root
Fix: Set mesg n in root's profile.
References: mesg(1)
Controls: CIS 5.4; NIST AC-6, AC-17; ISO 8.2, 8.5; CE User access control

The root user should not have the message capability turned on.  This
could lead to inadvertent modification of files with the root user is
logged in.
